title: $:/plugins/linonetwo/tidgi-routing-chain/language/en-GB/

Name: TidGi Routing Chain Indicator
Description: Show why a tiddler is routed to a public or private workspace, with the highest-priority tag chain in the toolbar tooltip.
Button/PublicCaption: Public note
Button/PrivateCaption: Private note
Button/MakePrivateCaption: Set as private note
Button/MakePublicCaption: Set as public note
Tooltip/Public: Routed to main workspace "{{workspace}}" via: {{chain}}
Tooltip/Private: Routed to sub-workspace "{{workspace}}" via: {{chain}}
Tooltip/Filter: Routed to "{{workspace}}" by filter: {{chain}}
Tooltip/HoverHint: Hover to load the routing chain
Tooltip/Unavailable: Routing info unavailable outside TidGi Desktop
